url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23984394"
abstract: >
  hapGWAS scans phased haplotype blocks under a shared null LMM projection.
  The default ranking column is an ACAT omnibus of joint, allele-marginal,
  and SNP scores. Exact block likelihood ratios, a nested beyond-SNP
  haplotype score, and an optional leave-one-window-out kinship downdate
  are also reported. The recorded Zenodo version DOI still refers to the
  0.4.1 deposit until a new version is minted.
keywords:
  - haplotype GWAS
  - linear mixed model
  - omnibus association
  - livestock genomics
